      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've had this happen to me, as well. The user who blocked me did *not* have a modified client (as far as I know).\nI figured it might be some kind of network/client update error, so I went into their moderation panel and muted then unmuted them.\nWhen I did that, it updated and I could no longer see them and they could no longer see me.",
